WEBVTT

00:11:29.435 --> 00:11:32.479
So, cast your minds to 2100,

00:11:32.479 --> 00:11:35.649
and a world after capitalism
as we know it.

00:11:36.191 --> 00:11:39.862
You go to your job four hours a day
in an elderly care center,

00:11:39.862 --> 00:11:43.699
one of the few labor-intensive industries
that's still around.

00:11:44.616 --> 00:11:48.328
Afterwards, you go for lunch,
you see your friends

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.957
and you talk about taking that holiday
in some rewilded forest somewhere,

00:11:51.957 --> 00:11:54.918
go see some bison and some bears.

00:11:54.918 --> 00:11:58.046
And you talk about wanting to study
for that third college degree,

00:11:58.088 --> 00:11:59.339
this time in medicine,

00:11:59.339 --> 00:12:01.300
because you're working with older people